WEBVTT

00:06:59.957 --> 00:07:03.586
But this thing would happen
when we would do a women's sports segment:

00:07:03.586 --> 00:07:05.629
Many of the other men on the segment ...

00:07:06.797 --> 00:07:08.340
didn’t really do their homework.

00:07:09.467 --> 00:07:11.469
So they were kind of "blah."

00:07:11.469 --> 00:07:13.929
Then, the segment would be kind of "blah."

00:07:13.929 --> 00:07:15.598
There's actually a term for this,

00:07:15.598 --> 00:07:17.391
it's called "gender bland."

00:07:18.309 --> 00:07:20.060
And then, the segment would end,

00:07:20.102 --> 00:07:21.687
and the producer would be like,

00:07:21.729 --> 00:07:23.856
"See? This is why we never
do women's sports,

00:07:23.856 --> 00:07:25.524
because they're boring."

00:07:26.275 --> 00:07:30.279
When a men's segment fell flat,
the problem was us.